==== Identify your Hardware Revision ====
{{ media:tenda:w306r_vid.jpg?200}}
It is possible to identify the version using the web interface but if you do not have this access, you may need to open the device and read the circuit board.
To identify your hardware version of W306R you can open the device, or check in the settings page of the router. After logging in to the routers html setup page use the links on the left to select "System Status" then scroll down to the last line in the table which may read "Hardware Version 	2.0" or similar.


==== Method 1 ====
Using a serial connection:
  - -> [[#identify_your_hardware_revision|Identify your Hardware Version]] and therefore, your options.
  - -> [[#serial|Connect a Serial Cable]] (Soldering recommended).
  - -> [[:downloads]].
  - -> Setup a PC using instructions here: [[inbox:howto:netboot|NetBoot]] or here [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp]].


Now when rebooting the router you have two options:
  - Load system code to SDRAM via TFTP.\\ Uses the ram of the router and will not overwrite firmware, if the router looses power or is reset in software it will then boot the OEM firmware. Use image named **openwrt-ramips-rt305x-w306r-v20-initramfs-uImage.bin**\\ \\ **OR**\\ \\
  - Load system code then write to Flash via TFTP.\\ Will overwrite the old firmware with OpenWrt and you should use **openwrt-ramips-rt305x-w306r-v20-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin**

==== Method 2 ====
OEM Installation, Flash using a binary compatible with the OEM upgrade method
  - Access the routers html settings web pages, default settings are:
    * Address: ''%%http://192.168.0.1%%''
    * User name: admin
    * password: admin
  - Using left section select **+ System Tools** then **Upgrade**
  - Use Browse to select the correct firmware file (**openwrt-ramips-rt305x-w306r-v20-squashfs-factory.bin**)
  - Then click upload (select OK to the are you sure question).
  - The router will upgrade and reboot then follow the OpenWrt [[:docs:guide-quick-start:walkthrough_login|firstlogin]]
                                                   
                                             
